      "flags": {},
      "order": 5,
      "mode": 0,
      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "title": "AD&D Character Portrait Generator V2.4 - Basic Workflow",
      "properties": {
        "widget_ue_connectable": {}
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "AD&D Character Portrait Generator V2.4\n--------------------------------------\n\nA polished, plug-and-play workflow for **ComfyUI** that generates rich, stylized **RPG character portraits** — perfect for **AD&D**, **Pathfinder**, and any fantasy setting. Featuring a clean layout, custom controls, and my very own **RPG-Characters** node for detailed character customization.\n\nNow easier than ever to use — **no dependencies**, no fuss, just results. 🎨⚔️\n\n---\n\n🧠 How to Install RPG-Characters Node\n\n1. Open **ComfyUI Manager** (via sidebar or `custom_nodes` menu).\n2. Navigate to the *Install Custom Nodes* tab.\n3. Search for: `RPG-Characters`\n4. Click **Install** – ZERO dependencies!!! (You're welcome. 😉)\n5. Restart ComfyUI and you're ready to go.\n\n---\n\n🟨 Build Process 🟨\n\nThis workflow is designed to run **out-of-the-box**, but if you want to fine-tune things, here are the configurable parts grouped for convenience:\n\n- 🟪 Seed Generator\n  Added so you can Switch between Fixed and random seeds.\n\n- 🟪 Empty Latent Images\n  Default should be ok, but keep it square, keep it safe!.\n\n- 🟪 Load Checkpoint\n  Optimized for Proteus v0.3 (https://civitai.com/models/267242?modelVersionId=343109) — but feel free to use any SD/SDXL model you prefer.\n\n- 🟪 Sampler + Scheduler + Steps\n  Default should be ok, but pick whats best for your Checkpoint.\n  Steps end/start are calculated for optimal results based on steps input.\n  Depending on your model and setup - don't go lower than 8\n\n\n---\n\n🟦 RPG Character Configuration 🟦\n\nThis is where the *magic* happens — powered by **custom RPG nodes** made specifically for immersive character creation.\n\n- ⬜ RPG Art Style Selector\n  Pick the art style you want for your character: Anime, Realistic, Dark Fantasy, etc.\n\n- ⬜ RPG Character Builder\n  Customize Race, Gender, Age, Class, Hair, Clothing, Emotion, Scene, and more.\n  \n  Now Includes DNA Locker:\n\n  🧬 DNA Locker\n  Your character's genetic playground. 🎲\n\n  - 🎲 Re-roll individual traits — keep rolling until you find one you like.\n  - 🎲 Re-roll the Master Seed — generate a completely new DNA combination.\n  - 🧬 DNA Sculptor — blend the nearest three variants for finer control.\n  - 👁️ Live feedback — DNA changes are shown immediately, so you can experiment\n    before generating an image.\n  - 🔢 Reproducible — the Master Seed lets you recreate the same DNA combination.\n\n  In short: roll the dice, find a combination you like, sculpt it if you want\n  more control, then run the workflow.\n\n  ⚠️ DNA isn't an exact science...\n  Diffusion models can be a little loose with genetics, so results won't always\n  perfectly match the DNA Locker. DNA is fragile. Handle with care. 🧬😏\n\n  Your character. Your DNA. Your dice.\n\n---\n\n🚀 That’s It!\n\nOnce you've tweaked your inputs (or left them at default), **just run the workflow** and enjoy your character portrait.\n\nHappy questing! 🐉🛡️"
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "AD&D Character Portrait Generator V2.4\n--------------------------------------\n\nA polished, plug-and-play workflow for **ComfyUI** that generates rich, stylized **RPG character portraits** — perfect for **AD&D**, **Pathfinder**, and any fantasy setting. Featuring a clean layout, custom controls, and my very own **RPG-Characters** node for detailed character customization.\n\nNow easier than ever to use — **no dependencies**, no fuss, just results. 🎨⚔️\n\n---\n\n🧠 How to Install RPG-Characters Node\n\n1. Open **ComfyUI Manager** (via sidebar or `custom_nodes` menu).\n2. Navigate to the *Install Custom Nodes* tab.\n3. Search for: `RPG-Characters`\n4. Click **Install** – ZERO dependencies!!! (You're welcome. 😉)\n5. Restart ComfyUI and you're ready to go.\n\n---\n\n🟨 Build Process 🟨\n\nThis workflow is designed to run **out-of-the-box**, but if you want to fine-tune things, here are the configurable parts grouped for convenience:\n\n- 🟪 Seed Generator\n  Added so you can Switch between Fixed and random seeds.\n\n- 🟪 Empty Latent Images\n  Default should be ok, but keep it square, keep it safe!.\n\n- 🟪 Load Checkpoint\n  Optimized for Proteus v0.3 (https://civitai.com/models/267242?modelVersionId=343109) — but feel free to use any SD/SDXL model you prefer.\n\n- 🟪 Sampler + Scheduler + Steps\n  Default should be ok, but pick whats best for your Checkpoint.\n  Steps end/start are calculated for optimal results based on steps input.\n  Depending on your model and setup - don't go lower than 8\n\n\n---\n\n🟦 RPG Character Configuration 🟦\n\nThis is where the *magic* happens — powered by **custom RPG nodes** made specifically for immersive character creation.\n\n- ⬜ RPG Art Style Selector\n  Pick the art style you want for your character: Anime, Realistic, Dark Fantasy, etc.\n\n- ⬜ RPG Character Builder\n  Customize Race, Gender, Age, Class, Hair, Clothing, Emotion, Scene, and more.\n  \n  Now Includes DNA Locker:\n\n  🧬 DNA Locker\n  Your character's genetic playground. 🎲\n\n  - 🎲 Re-roll individual traits — keep rolling until you find one you like.\n  - 🎲 Re-roll the Master Seed — generate a completely new DNA combination.\n  - 🧬 DNA Sculptor — blend the nearest three variants for finer control.\n  - 👁️ Live feedback — DNA changes are shown immediately, so you can experiment\n    before generating an image.\n  - 🔢 Reproducible — the Master Seed lets you recreate the same DNA combination.\n\n  In short: roll the dice, find a combination you like, sculpt it if you want\n  more control, then run the workflow.\n\n  ⚠️ DNA isn't an exact science...\n  Diffusion models can be a little loose with genetics, so results won't always\n  perfectly match the DNA Locker. DNA is fragile. Handle with care. 🧬😏\n\n  Your character. Your DNA. Your dice.\n\n---\n\n🚀 That’s It!\n\nOnce you've tweaked your inputs (or left them at default), **just run the workflow** and enjoy your character portrait.\n\nHappy questing! 🐉🛡️"
      },
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653",
      "shape": "box"
